OL,3,GNEWSAPrincess of Wales visits baby
OL,4,Adevelopment project
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess of Wales has heard about
OL,7,Fefforts to flag up early social
OL,8,Fwithdrawal in babies and toddlers
OL,9,Fduring a visit to a clinic.
OL,11,FCatherine visited the Chase Community
OL,12,FHospital in Bordon, Hampshire and met
OL,13,Fhealth visitors who use an
OL,14,Fobservational tool, called the Alarm
OL,15,FDistress Baby Scale (ADBB).
OL,17,FHealthcare and childcare professionals
OL,18,Fuse the approach to focus on babies'
OL,19,Feye contact, facial expressions and
OL,20,Factivity levels to help understand
OL,21,Ftheir social behaviour and identify
OL,22,Fwhere more support is needed.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
